  "body": "Sharp contemporary lines, warm timber accents and a glass-fronted balcony give this newly built, freestanding home an attractive modern presence. Set on a flat freehold section, it combines a practical family layout with easy everyday living.\r\n\r\nWestlake Boys' High School and Forrest Hill School are just across the road, while Westlake Girls' High School is also within walking distance. With schooling so conveniently placed, families can enjoy fewer car trips and less time spent waiting at the school gates.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor brings together an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a connected space for cooking, gathering and relaxing. A guest toilet and internal-access single garage complete this practical level.\r\n\r\nAll four bedrooms are upstairs, including a master with its own ensuite and access to the balcony. A separate family bathroom serves the other three bedrooms, keeping the sleeping spaces comfortably separate from the main living area.\r\n\r\nWith Milford's shops, cafés and beach within easy reach, this stylish home offers convenience throughout the working week and plenty to enjoy at the weekend.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Freestanding home on a flat, freehold section\r\n* Four bedrooms, two bathrooms and a guest toilet\r\n* Master bedroom with ensuite and balcony access\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n* Internal-access single garage\r\n* Approx. 148.3m² floor area, including garage, excluding balcony\r\n* Additional 6m² balcony\r\n* Walk to Forrest Hill School, Westlake Boys and Westlake Girls\r\n\r\nContact Lily today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nAreas are based on the supplied plans and are subject to final confirmation.",
